            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-diurnal-24-hour-thermosiphon-flute-velocity-u-flute-t-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-equatorward-solar-tracking-spire-tilt-vs-latitude-phi-0-24-deg-s-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-shaded-isothermal-no-buoyancy-negative-control-pe-0-0-dt-0-k-aspect-ratio-h-w>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-specimen-cathedral-termite-mound-estimated-full-perimeter-surface-flute-count>,
