            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-specimen-cathedral-termite-mound-spire-taper-half-angle>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-measurement-wild-type-macrotermes-michaelseni-pe-3-2-cathedral-spire-aspect-ratio-h-w>,
